ave already supported Ukraine with  almost 20 billion euros  and this does not include our military  assistance  is the world's second largest  humanitarian donor to Ukraine per capita  from a small country like yours comes a  great example  for our entire Union we are so grateful  for this  we will continue to stand by Ukraine  because ukrainians are fighting for Hope  in a better future a European future  the same way your city and your nation  have struggled to be free  I wish you a wonderful discussion  Long Live Europe thank you
 

